{"parse": {"title": "PD-01", "pageid": 144770, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-00\" title=\"PD-00\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-02\" title=\"PD-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9C.A8.E6.B8.85.E6.96.B0.E7.A9.BA.E6.B0.94.E9.87.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"在清新空气里\">在清新空气里</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 在清新空气里</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Breathing a Different Air</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>象<span class=\"color-value\"></span>监<span class=\"color-value\"></span>测<span class=\"color-value\"></span>显<span class=\"color-value\"></span>示<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>降<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_01\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁浮列车滑过坚实可靠的轨道，于高空中穿梭。“旋风号”车厢内，乘客们低声讨论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅰ：</div><div>也就是说，像蚁群渡水一样……我们可以让材料具备自我修复机制……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅰ：</div><div>集体……根植在基因的记忆里，直至种群的最后一个个体……时间亦难侵蚀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔讶异地打量对面的人。窗外，群山飞速倒退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你身上的外套……也是那台仪器的作用吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，有时，干涉仪也会自动为我们匹配服饰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不过你和X本身的穿着似乎已经足够融入这里的人们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>邻座乘客的话题似乎告一段落，他遂而起身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们端着酒杯路过，去车尾与另一群聚在一起交谈的科学家们会合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅰ：</div><div>我们现在距离地面至少有40米。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅱ：</div><div>保守估计，帕乌科夫同志。照我看，这高度抵得上一架中型火箭——就架在那座山脊上吧，我看位置正好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>您还是一如既往地爱开玩笑，布朗同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一台浮空机器人拎着一杯酒飞过X的头顶，停在了科学家们的旁边，放下酒杯后，再次按照原路返回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>以本职工作进行身份伪装，相当巧妙的耦合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天际，浮空的机械已经化为几枚白点。它们总是匆匆路过，奔往既定的方向。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_cg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_cg_08\"><img alt=\"s02_cg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-s02_cg_08.png/600px-Cg-s02_cg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-s02_cg_08.png/900px-Cg-s02_cg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-s02_cg_08.png/1200px-Cg-s02_cg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几片山影掠过，眼前便开阔了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>一片望不见尽头的金色麦田……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>豁然开朗的平原上，丰饶的金色一直铺到地平线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>令人心生宁静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迎着灿烂的阳光，小梅斯梅尔注意到了麦田中的几个黑点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>噢……还有进行农作的机器人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人机正喷洒着某种液体，紧随其后地，一台门框形的机器正照顾着农作物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>看起来像，旁边站着的是科学家？也许我们路过了一片试验田。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650319.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-650319.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650319.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650319.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-650319.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650319.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-650319.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650319.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不是的，先生，这就是普通的田地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_01\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-s02_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人转过头去，陌生男子站在他们身旁，毫不见外地继续说了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那些站在机器人旁边的白大褂们就是农民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>既是农民，同时也是科学家，在苏联，这并不冲突。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>农业机器人能够细致负责地帮助人们完成一些琐碎又费时的农活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>人们就可以用省下来的时间学习更多的知识，再反哺到实际的粮食生产中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不仅是农业，各行各业都是如此，这就是如今苏联的生产生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>非常感谢您的纠正，如果您再能介绍一下您的名字就更好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>抱歉，我叫马克西姆，是一名记者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>想必三位就是维尔汀博士、X博士和小梅斯梅尔博士了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。你认识我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>这次参与聚合物国际峰会的科学家中，竟然会出现三位如此年轻就已经在自己的研究领域中颇有建树的科学家，大家对此都很关注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>而这里，符合特征的只有你们三位——我可以采访一下你们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们相互看了一眼后，X开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>可以，正好我们也需要一个人为我们多介绍一下这里。我们几乎对“苏联”一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>我明白，从哪里开始呢……噢，是的，“大集体”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>所有的机器人都受“大集体”的统一调配，时刻都保证它们的劳动力不会被浪费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>谁能想到如今机器人会成为我们的好伙伴？它们诚实、稳定、优雅、从容，会平等而热情地向每一位同志致意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>以机器人为基底的社会马不停蹄地运转，生产力提高，再也没有人受到压迫，人们的幸福感也跟着升上来了，美妙梦幻的新生活！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>太幸福了，幸福到……哈，好像大家都忘了，不久之前，这个国家处在怎样的水深火热之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你是指……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>一场始料未及的“瘟疫”。人们太沉浸在如今的幸福生活中了，以至于没人想过——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>那些将国家从“瘟疫”中拯救出来的、真正经历过绝望却仍旧托举起这个时代的人，反而无法享受这一切——这公平吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们对视一眼，眼中流露出抱歉之色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>抱歉，只是想起了一些伤心的事，你们正是享受生命的年纪，无需伤春悲秋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马克西姆隐藏起话语间透露出的愤懑，恢复了平静，开启新的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>那么，下一个问题，年轻人们，请告诉我，在你们国家，机器人的应用是否已经如此普遍？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯——这取决于你对“机器人”的定义，不过总的来说，我倒是经常与会思考的金属铁块打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>什么？很新奇。我以为我已经足够关注科学的新动向了，可它的发展实在是日新月异……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>这很好，这很好……这是进步的象征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我所结识的那位“机器人”曾负责整个机构的运转，但她对保持能源充足有着过度的执拗，因此在我们那儿，四处都配备了可及时使用的充电桩——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这里，似乎看不到这样的装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>噢，看来还得提到谢切诺夫博士发明的聚合物了。所有人都称赞，是他的这项发明拯救了我们的国家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“聚合物”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>简单来说，它是一种可编程的液体模块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>在本次聚合物国际峰会上，你们会彻底了解何为“聚合物”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>当然，也能亲眼见证谢切诺夫博士为众人称赞的另一杰出发明——双生舞伶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但您似乎并不这么认为？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>……噢，看来是我的措辞造成误会了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>我没有其他想法——只是以我的能力，说太多就是在误人子弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>等到了峰会现场，你们不妨亲身感受我们国家伟大的科学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>总之，基于对聚合物的研究，谢切诺夫博士的团队研制出了氢电池——是它使得机器人不再怎么需要充电了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>听上去，我们那儿有人十分需要这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旋风号”：</div><div>亲爱的旅客，列车已行驶到终点站，请于拉菲克处领取座驾激活码，涡轮车会将您送往聚合物国际峰会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>拉菲克？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>就是在列车上忙碌的机器人酒保，别担心，跟着我走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旋风号”：</div><div>请有序下车，“旋风号”期待您的再次光临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁浮列车平稳停下，年轻的访客们随着四周的科学家们一同走向车门口。拥挤的队列中，有一人异常显眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那位科学家……喝醉了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前方，一名眼神迷蒙的科学家正趴在同伴的身上，口齿不清地说着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>孩子？……他们……成年了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>我没听说哪个科学家代表团可以携带家属参会，还是说，他们把童子军夏令营的孩子们跟我们放在一起了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>不是这样的，布朗同志……这几位年轻人也是科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>科学家？他们？哈哈哈哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>至少我们不会在重要的会议前喝得酩酊大醉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>年轻人，年少有为啊！但你应该在家里享受暑假，荡荡秋千……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>您有些失礼了，布朗同志。同伴们还在外面等我们呢，快走吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他立刻开口打断了同伴无礼的话，搀扶着醉鬼，艰难地向车门挪去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X拿着一个苹果追了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>请等一下，吃点水果吧，对他的健康有好处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-624703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>谢谢你，很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿列克谢扶着伊桑快步离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>酒精，仅在医疗层面上，我承认它还是有一些正面作用的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马克西姆皱皱眉，露出无奈的表情，随后拍了拍X的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>别放在心上，年轻人们，展览馆见——再次欢迎你们来到3826号设施！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650318.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-650318.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650318.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650318.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-650318.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650318.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-650318.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650318.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>来，这位就是负责发放激活码的拉菲克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马克西姆走上前去，机器人的视觉感知器开始频繁地开合，与人类怀疑的检视如出一辙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉菲克：</div><div>通过，这是您的座驾激活码，祝您旅途愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马克西姆挥挥手离开了，拉菲克将头转向年轻的访客们，开始试图读取来访人的数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>等等，我们的身份……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>别担心——拉菲克，不必麻烦了，我们已经领取过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X制止了机器人的检视，如同变魔法般从口袋里掏出了一个座驾激活码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你怎么会有这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们可是要去参加聚合物国际峰会，我当然要准备万全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>看来有人进不去场馆的门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>难道是刚才递水果的时候，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嘘……这只是对他出言不逊的一点小教训。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉菲克：</div><div>好的，再见。祝您旅途愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">涡轮车：</div><div>请系好安全带，祝您一路顺风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“熊蜂”射出六条钢索，将涡轮车吊了起来，缓缓升高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>原来我们要去的场馆建在空中，真是有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>来，给我们的旅途再增添一些风味吧——听点当地的音乐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这里的确如资料所示，崇尚科学、理性与秩序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔，我想，你应该会喜欢这里，你大可把这次当作一场公费旅游。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这我倒不会否认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但如果是跟同事一起的话，应该叫作“出差”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>是学术交流，而且是茶歇很好吃的那种，维尔汀博士、小梅斯梅尔博士和……X博士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……总觉得只有我的身份发生了改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>旅途愉快。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-01"}}